cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AgriSafe AI in your work, please cite this project using the metadata below."

title: "AgriSafe AI: Explainable Deep Learning for Crop Disease Classification and Treatment Recommendation"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-23"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Chaudhary"
    given-names: "Vansh"

  - family-names: "Arora"
    given-names: "Aarnav"

repository-code: "https://github.com/noir-scale/AgriSafe-AI"
license: "MIT"
keywords:
  - deep learning
  - plant disease detection
  - transfer learning
  - ResNet50
  - CBAM attention
  - Grad-CAM
  - variational autoencoder
  - class imbalance
  - agricultural AI
  - explainable AI

abstract: >
  AgriSafe AI is a deep learning application for crop disease classification
  and treatment recommendation. The system uses a ResNet50 backbone augmented
  with dual CBAM attention modules and provides Grad-CAM visual explanations
  for model predictions. It also includes disease severity estimation and
  treatment recommendations.

